      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FidelityFX Super Resolution is now open source.\n\nThis is the perfect time for VRChat to implement it.\n\nI think everybody who plays VRChat regularly needs this, as any large instance is laggy no matter how good your PC is.\n\nhttps://gpuopen.com/fsr3-source-available/",
